Package: sqlife
Title: Extend RSQLite with higher level functions for common database usecases
Version: 0.3.1
Authors@R: 
    person("PJ", "Van Camp", , "pieterjanvc@hotmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: This package is aimed as people who regularly use SQLite databases
  in R but would like some higher level functions to more quickly create, maintain
  and transact with SQLite databases.
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
